  {
    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186115299,
      "id": "f9469d5c-e097-590c-8ddb-2c7fda353fac",
      "title": "Classifying a System as Consistent Dependent, Consistent Independent, or Inconsistent"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "6b0098fb-a8e0-52ac-8a70-6e22f3a5ff2a",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the following system of equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-x-4y &=1 \\\\ -2x-7y &=4 \\\\ 4x+15y &=-6.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nI. The system is consistent independent\n\nII. The system has no solution\n\nIII. The system is consistent dependent",
      ":question/worked-solution": "To classify the system, we first need to find its solution. The augmented matrix for this system is \n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-1 & -4 & 1 \\\\ -2 & -7 & 4 \\\\ 4 & 15 & -6\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-1 & -4 & 1 \\\\ -2 & -7 & 4 \\\\ 4 & 15 & -6\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-2){R}_{1} \\\\  & \u223c\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-1 & -4 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 4 & 15 & -6\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+4{R}_{1} \\\\  & \u223c\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-1 & -4 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & -1 & -2\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+{R}_{2} \\\\  & \u223c\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-1 & -4 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{array}\\right]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nSince any numbers $x$ and $y$ are solutions to the third equation $0x+0y=0$, we can remove this equation from the system. So, the corresponding system is now\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-x-4y &=1 \\\\ y &=2.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nFrom the second equation we have $y=2$ and substituting this into the first equation yields $x=-9.$ So,  we conclude that the system is consistent independent. \n\nAs a result, only statement I is true.",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "df2a385f-2248-516e-b85d-0a6209d15f7b",
          ":answer-field/key": "selection",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/radio",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "1ae4da97-e999-501b-a5bf-aa56c62bb6e0",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "II and III only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "52e86d7d-e2f2-5c2b-841f-5df9ee97dd6e",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "II only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "f94381dd-93f9-56f2-b025-beba8fd3e98b",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "I and II only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "b0295c09-5273-5003-b622-e8b17d6c9e07",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "I only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "a7730052-34ec-57e0-9096-e82a43a6b514",
