  {
    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186115299,
      "id": "f9469d5c-e097-590c-8ddb-2c7fda353fac",
      "title": "Classifying a System as Consistent Dependent, Consistent Independent, or Inconsistent"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "65e34951-af78-5b32-bda5-cff8ab637699",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the following system of equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-2x-4y &=-3 \\\\ -6x-14y &=-6 \\\\ 4x+8y &=6.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** The system is consistent independent\n- **II.** The system has no solution\n- **III.** The system is consistent dependent",
      ":question/worked-solution": "To classify the system, we first need to find its solution. The augmented matrix for this system is \n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-2 & -4 & -3 \\\\ -6 & -14 & -6 \\\\ 4 & 8 & 6\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-2 & -4 & -3 \\\\ -6 & -14 & -6 \\\\ 4 & 8 & 6\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-3){R}_{1} \\\\  & \u223c\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-2 & -4 & -3 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 4 & 8 & 6\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+2{R}_{1} \\\\  & \u223c\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-2 & -4 & -3 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{array}\\right]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nSince any numbers $x$ and $y$ are solutions to the third equation $0x+0y=0$, we can remove this equation from the system. So, the corresponding system is now\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-2x-4y &=-3 \\\\ -2y &=3.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nFrom the second equation we have $y=-\\frac{3}{2}$ and substituting this into the first equation yields $x=\\frac{9}{2}.$ So,  we conclude that the system is consistent independent. \n\nAs a result, only statement I is true.",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "3bcfedac-e54e-53fb-b18f-240a5ee071c8",
          ":answer-field/key": "I",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox",
